    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Now</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/e422d849c0168801996d695ee960b1ad.avif?t=1739198458\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Royale</strong>\u00a0combines the gripping gameplay of Action Roguelite Bullet Heaven games with a unique approach to competitive multiplayer, giving you the chance to not only slay monsters but to be the best at doing that!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/b36d706f35db13f024b783899062b92d.poster.avif?t=1739198458\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/b36d706f35db13f024b783899062b92d.webm?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/b36d706f35db13f024b783899062b92d.mp4?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge hordes of monsters which get stronger and more by the minute! On this seasons battlefield you can encounter small, big, cute, angry and bossy cyber dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/887a126290c9b41aa94b8dd52119a14e.poster.avif?t=1739198458\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/887a126290c9b41aa94b8dd52119a14e.webm?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/887a126290c9b41aa94b8dd52119a14e.mp4?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your Fighter, level up and choose from tons of active and passive abilities to become the strongest version of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/160ab9934b8cb111547f112d015f9a02.poster.avif?t=1739198458\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/160ab9934b8cb111547f112d015f9a02.webm?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/160ab9934b8cb111547f112d015f9a02.mp4?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote with other players on map-changing Events to make your und their lives even harder. You're a streamer? Even better, let your chat decide how to torture you. They know best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/eb5379218ac6b6e31d10c351baf9dc1e.poster.avif?t=1739198458\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/eb5379218ac6b6e31d10c351baf9dc1e.webm?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/eb5379218ac6b6e31d10c351baf9dc1e.mp4?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly! Face other players playing alongside you in their own arenas. Face the same monsters, events and challenges at the same time, survive the longest and claim the bullet heaven throne.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Royale</strong>\u00a0combines the gripping gameplay of Action Roguelite Bullet Heaven games with a unique approach to competitive multiplayer, giving you the chance to not only slay monsters but to be the best at doing that!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/b36d706f35db13f024b783899062b92d.poster.avif?t=1739198458\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/b36d706f35db13f024b783899062b92d.webm?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/b36d706f35db13f024b783899062b92d.mp4?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge hordes of monsters which get stronger and more by the minute! On this seasons battlefield you can encounter small, big, cute, angry and bossy cyber dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/887a126290c9b41aa94b8dd52119a14e.poster.avif?t=1739198458\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/887a126290c9b41aa94b8dd52119a14e.webm?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/887a126290c9b41aa94b8dd52119a14e.mp4?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your Fighter, level up and choose from tons of active and passive abilities to become the strongest version of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/160ab9934b8cb111547f112d015f9a02.poster.avif?t=1739198458\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/160ab9934b8cb111547f112d015f9a02.webm?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/160ab9934b8cb111547f112d015f9a02.mp4?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote with other players on map-changing Events to make your und their lives even harder. You're a streamer? Even better, let your chat decide how to torture you. They know best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/eb5379218ac6b6e31d10c351baf9dc1e.poster.avif?t=1739198458\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/eb5379218ac6b6e31d10c351baf9dc1e.webm?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503200/extras/eb5379218ac6b6e31d10c351baf9dc1e.mp4?t=1739198458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly! Face other players playing alongside you in their own arenas. Face the same monsters, events and challenges at the same time, survive the longest and claim the bullet heaven throne.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the arena, where relentless hordes and rival survivors challenge your every move! Fight, evolve, and influence the world around you \u2014 but you\u2019re not alone. Other players face the same trials, fighting to outlast the competition. Smash your way to the top in this multiplayer bullet heaven game!",
